      "text": "[9:20PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving well from Anthony to Maryland intersection, Odo Yalaro, and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way in both directions. \nMovement is also smooth on Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, and Oba Akinjobi Way in Ikeja GRA. \nBoth Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge are clear. \nOfficers are on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
