      "text": "[9:40PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement on CMS Bridge to Ijora Olopa has eased. \nMovement is steady on Broad Street to Apongbon and Offin Canal Market. \nEko Bridge to Apongbon and CMS is moving well, with good flow through UBA Roundabout and Marina. \nNo impediments reported, and officers are visible on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
